; A junction with a net inflow supplies the area around it, so the
; group it belongs to is not taken out of service. J3 injects 5 gpm
; and feeds J4 through PI1; closed pipes PC1 & PC2 cut both off from
; the reservoir.

[TITLE]
Inflow junction as a supply source

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID    Elev    Demand
 J1    100     50
 J2    100     50
 J3    100     -5
 J4    90      5

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID    Head
 R1    200

[PIPES]
;ID    Node1  Node2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1    R1     J1     1000    12    100    0      OPEN
 P2    J1     J2     1000    12    100    0      OPEN
 PC1   J2     J3     1000    12    100    0      CLOSED
 PC2   J1     J4     1000    12    100    0      CLOSED
 PI1   J3     J4     1000    12    100    0      OPEN

[OPTIONS]
 Isolation Yes
 Units     GPM
 Headloss  H-W
 Trials    40
 Accuracy  0.001

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[REPORT]
 Status    No
 Summary   No
 Page      0

[END]
